{"type":"message","id":"48ea0b8c","parentId":"dbc3f53a","timestamp":"2026-03-14T08:10:17.874Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-14 16:10 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 作为 Executor Subagent，执行公告抓取：\n\n用 Playwright 访问以下3个网站，提取最新公告列表：\n\n1. 厦门市人力资源和社会保障局 http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/\n2. 厦门科学技术局 http://sti.xm.gov.cn/\n3. 福建省科技厅 http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn/\n\n对于每个网站，提取最新的5-10条公告，格式：\n| 标题 | 发布日期 | 链接 |\n\n把结果保存到 ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/.learnings/公告列表-2026-03-14.md"}],"timestamp":1773475817873}}
{"type":"message","id":"184bfdec","parentId":"48ea0b8c","timestamp":"2026-03-14T08:10:27.942Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求我作为 Executor Subagent 执行公告抓取任务。我需要：\n1. 使用 Playwright 访问3个网站\n2. 提取最新公告列表（5-10条）\n3. 保存到指定路径\n\n让我先检查是否有 Playwright 可用，然后开始抓取。由于有3个网站，我可以并行访问它们来提高效率。\n\n首先检查 Playwright 是否安装，然后开始抓取。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来执行公告抓取任务。先检查 Playwright 环境，然后并行访问3个网站。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_68ffcec3cc5749669d2a9b77","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"which playwright || npx playwright --version 2>/dev/null || echo \"需要安装\"","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773475817874}}
