{"type":"message","id":"29b848f1","parentId":"af99d65d","timestamp":"2026-03-14T08:12:43.318Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"网站结构可能更复杂，选择器没匹配到。我需要先检查页面内容来了解实际的DOM结构。让我先分别查看每个网站的内容。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"选择器没匹配到，我需要先检查页面实际内容。让我分别访问每个网站看看结构：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1a2ecaf319a84dce9ca06f51","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nimport asyncio\nfrom playwright.async_api import async_playwright\n\nasync def check_page(url, name):\n    async with async_playwright() as p:\n        browser = await p.chromium.launch(headless=True)\n        page = await browser.new_page()\n        try:\n            await page.goto(url, timeout=30000, wait_until=\"domcontentloaded\")\n            await page.wait_for_timeout(3000)\n            content = await page.content()\n            # 查找包含\"公告\"或\"通知\"的链接\n            import re\n            links = re.findall(r'<a[^>]*href=\"([^\"]+)\"[^>]*>([^<]{5,50}?)</a>', content, re.I)\n            print(f\"\\n=== {name} ===\")\n            for href, text in links[:15]:\n                if any(k in text for k in ['公告', '通知', '公示', '新闻']):\n                    print(f\"{text[:40]} -> {href}\")\n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"{name}: {e}\")\n        finally:\n            await browser.close()\n\nasyncio.run(check_page(\"http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/\", \"厦门人社局\"))\nasyncio.run(check_page(\"http://sti.xm.gov.cn/\", \"厦门科技局\"))\nasyncio.run(check_page(\"http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn/\", \"福建科技厅\"))\nEOF","timeout":90}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773475927948}}
