{"type":"message","id":"692dd3a3","parentId":"068f1e29","timestamp":"2026-03-14T08:13:13.593Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"页面内容获取有问题，可能是JavaScript动态加载的，或者页面结构很特殊。让我用更详细的方式检查页面。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"页面可能是动态加载的。让我用不同方式检查，并等待更长时间：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4fa5f2d6a95441848d38da93","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nimport asyncio\nfrom playwright.async_api import async_playwright\n\nasync def check_page(url, name):\n    async with async_playwright() as p:\n        browser = await p.chromium.launch(headless=True)\n        page = await browser.new_page()\n        try:\n            response = await page.goto(url, timeout=30000)\n            print(f\"{name} 状态码: {response.status}\")\n            \n            # 等待页面渲染\n            await page.wait_for_timeout(5000)\n            \n            # 获取所有链接\n            all_links = await page.query_selector_all(\"a\")\n            print(f\"找到 {len(all_links)} 个链接\")\n            \n            # 获取可见文本\n            body_text = await page.evaluate(\"\"\"() => {\n                return document.body.innerText;\n            }\"\"\")\n            print(f\"页面文本片段: {body_text[:500]}...\")\n            \n        except Exception as e:\n            print(f\"{name}: {e}\")\n        finally:\n            await browser.close()\n\nasyncio.run(check_page(\"http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/\", \"厦门人社局\"))\nEOF","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773475976842}}
