{"type":"message","id":"36795b73","parentId":"93e73c36","timestamp":"2026-03-14T08:17:49.825Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"找到了！现在我可以看到页面结构了。三个网站都有公告列表，但格式略有不同：\n\n1. 厦门人社局：日期在方括号[]里，标题在后面\n2. 厦门科技局：标题在前，日期在后（没有方括号）\n3. 福建科技厅：标题在前，日期在后\n\n现在我需要写一个脚本来提取这些信息，包括链接。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了！页面结构清楚了。现在让我提取完整的公告信息（包括链接）：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c8dd37e9449247ffbd483ba2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nimport asyncio\nfrom playwright.async_api import async_playwright\nimport json\n\nasync def scrape_all():\n    results = {}\n    \n    async with async_playwright() as p:\n        browser = await p.chromium.launch(headless=True)\n        page = await browser.new_page()\n        \n        # 1. 厦门人社局\n        print(\"抓取: 厦门市人力资源和社会保障局...\")\n        await page.goto(\"http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/\", timeout=30000)\n        await page.wait_for_timeout(3000)\n        \n        items = await page.evaluate(\"\"\"() => {\n            const lis = document.querySelectorAll('li.b-free-read-leaf');\n            const result = [];\n            lis.forEach(li => {\n                const a = li.querySelector('a');\n                const span = li.querySelector('span');\n                if (a && span) {\n                    result.push({\n                        title: a.innerText.trim(),\n                        date: span.innerText.trim(),\n                        href: a.href\n                    });\n                }\n            });\n            return result;\n        }\"\"\")\n        results[\"厦门市人力资源和社会保障局\"] = items[:10]\n        \n        # 2. 厦门科技局\n        print(\"抓取: 厦门科学技术局...\")\n        await page.goto(\"http://sti.xm.gov.cn/\", timeout=30000)\n        await page.wait_for_timeout(3000)\n        \n        items = await page.evaluate(\"\"\"() => {\n            const lis = document.querySelectorAll('li.b-free-read-leaf');\n            const result = [];\n            lis.forEach(li => {\n                const a = li.querySelector('a');\n                if (a) {\n                    // 获取标题文本（去掉日期）\n                    const fullText = a.innerText.trim();\n                    // 标题和日期的格式是：标题 + 日期\n                    const dateMatch = fullText.match(/(.+?)(\\\\d{4}-\\\\d{2}-\\\\d{2})$/);\n                    const title = dateMatch ? dateMatch[1].trim() : fullText;\n                    const date = dateMatch ? dateMatch[2].trim() : '';\n                    \n                    result.push({\n                        title: title,\n                        date: date,\n                        href: a.href\n                    });\n                }\n            });\n            return result;\n        }\"\"\")\n        results[\"厦门科学技术局\"] = items[:10]\n        \n        # 3. 福建科技厅\n        print(\"抓取: 福建省科技厅...\")\n        await page.goto(\"http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn/\", timeout=30000)\n        await page.wait_for_timeout(3000)\n        \n        items = await page.evaluate(\"\"\"() => {\n            const lis = document.querySelectorAll('li.b-free-read-leaf, li[class=\"\"]');\n            const result = [];\n            lis.forEach(li => {\n                const a = li.querySelector('a');\n                if (a) {\n                    const fullText = a.innerText.trim();\n                    const dateMatch = fullText.match(/(.+?)(\\\\d{4}-\\\\d{2}-\\\\d{2})$/);\n                    const title = dateMatch ? dateMatch[1].trim() : fullText;\n                    const date = dateMatch ? dateMatch[2].trim() : '';\n                    \n                    if (title.length > 5) {\n                        result.push({\n                            title: title,\n                            date: date,\n                            href: a.href\n                        });\n                    }\n                }\n            });\n            return result;\n        }\"\"\")\n        results[\"福建省科技厅\"] = items[:10]\n        \n        await browser.close()\n    \n    return results\n\nresults = asyncio.run(scrape_all())\nprint(json.dumps(results, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\nEOF","timeout":90}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773476230176}}
